      "review_note_append": "M06-BHARTIARTL-ILLUSTRATIVE-CLAIM-ALLOWANCE-20261103. Retrospective 31 March 2026 INR illustration, not a current company valuation. Parent denominator 6,095,062,981 assumes all partly paid shares and all 3,167 thousand parent options convert, after deducting reported 2,497 thousand treasury shares; no proceeds credited. The INR14,905,660,000 additional equity-claim allowance is an arbitrary 1% of reported parent book equity, selected only for a conditional illustration. It is not employee-option fair value, expected loss or a proven upper bound. Stress the allowance from 0% to 5% of book; actual residual subsidiary awards and incremental AMC puts remain unknown. Keep existing aggregate NCI deduction and do not additionally deduct the full overlapping AMC redemption liability. Keep INR14% direct hurdle, 0% growth, reported margin, 25% assumed tax, and no current-price comparison. Approval is required before applying or promoting this scenario.",
